# Activate the Nix flake dev shell via direnv: run `direnv allow` once per clone.
#
# The flake is read through git, so Nix only sees files git knows about:
# stage or commit a new file before it can affect the shell.
#
# Nix's bundled libgit2 rejects repositories that use reftable ref storage
# ("unsupported extension name extensions.refstorage"). This repository uses
# the `files` format. If a fresh clone hits that error, fix the repo:
#   git refs migrate --ref-format=files
# then run `direnv reload`.
watch_file flake.nix
watch_file flake.lock
use flake
